+        /// <summary>
+        /// Root-classification regression (stats kinds 11-22). A downstream WASM host whose
+        /// teardown reports NotQuiescent forever needs to know WHICH class of root holds the
+        /// condemned context's LoaderAllocator witness — managed reflection cannot enumerate raw
