+	 * The generation token. The ONE property it must have is that CONSECUTIVE SNAPSHOTS DIFFER,
+	 * because kind 20 is a read token: a token that stopped changing would make every subsequent
+	 * mixed-generation read look single-generation, i.e. the surface would stop detecting tears
